Package: djr-studio
Version: 1.0.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: djrecycle <djrecycle@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libasound2, libjack-jackd2-0, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxinerama1, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libgl1, libcurl4
Description: DJR_Studio Linux DAW
 DJR_Studio is a native JUCE-based DAW prototype for Linux with a modular
 audio engine, MIDI tools, mixer, piano roll, step sequencer, VST3 host
 foundation, project saving, recording, export, and Debian packaging.
